        <body>
            <div xml:id="d441">

                <pb facs="0660" n="572" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg572"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Blaine to Mr. Hirsch.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-05-13"><hi rendition="#italic">May 13,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 327.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose for your information a copy of a
                    letter from Mr. David Metheny, of Mersine, Turkey, commending your intervention
                    with the Ottoman Government, to protect American educational establishments in
                    Turkey from the application of the adverse order of January 6, 1892.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">James G. Blaine.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d441-a1.xml" xpointer="d441-a1"/>
            </div>
